      "writtenOn": "2025-02-10T22:24:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Oh, just figured out why. `makeVarsSingleton` (which collects all `MakeVars` contributions) is [registered later than other singletons](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:build/soong/android/register.go;l\u003d199;drc\u003dfc7a41126db7147c5b6863fe43ce552ece62bf57), so it\u0027s guaranteed that its `GenerateBuildActions` is run later than those of other singletons. So maybe we should do the same for `androidMkSingleton`? WDYT?",
      "parentUuid": "f79556fb_1db2a3ab",
      "revId": "de6dfdeaeacdada13a4cf2ac3a8b19cb595256dc",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "6b962e98_00b2954f",
        "filename": "/COMMIT_MSG",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 14,
      "author": {
        "id": 1535516
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-02-10T22:45:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ah. I wouldn\u0027t want to move `androidMkSingleton` later, as it gives more opportunites to generate make code, but maybe it\u0027s time to split the soong-only portion of it out into its own singleton that is run late.\n\nHowever, we could just treat this project as \"migrate all ctx.Dist calls to GenerateAndroidBuildActions\" in which case we wouldn\u0027t need to worry about when the singleton runs.\n\nIf there is something that can\u0027t be moved into GenerateAndroidBuildActions we would have to do it though.",
      "parentUuid": "94202341_21f1d932",
      "revId": "de6dfdeaeacdada13a4cf2ac3a8b19cb595256dc",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "01e05c17_ab08916a",
        "filename": "/COMMIT_MSG",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 14,
      "author": {
        "id": 1962375
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-02-10T22:51:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e However, we could just treat this project as \"migrate all ctx.Dist calls to GenerateAndroidBuildActions\" in which case we wouldn\u0027t need to worry about when the singleton runs.\n\nThis means that all **singletons** that call `ctx.Dist*` should be converted to **singleton modules** (and likewise for all singletons that will be added in the future). TBH I think it\u0027s logical for `androidMkSingleton` to run later than other singletons given that it depends on other singletons (more specifically their dist contributions). WDYT?",
      "parentUuid": "6b962e98_00b2954f",
      "revId": "de6dfdeaeacdada13a4cf2ac3a8b19cb595256dc",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "573af02e_a183a0f5",
        "filename": "/COMMIT_MSG",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 14,
      "author": {
        "id": 1535516
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-02-10T22:55:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Are there singletons that dist files? Our collection code only supports dists from modules, and then also the globally registered make vars providers, which I suppose could dist files that come from singletons, but I hoped that the pattern was rare enough that it wasn\u0027t an issue.\n\nIf there are, we should definetly move our singleton later rather than making those into singletonModules.",
      "parentUuid": "01e05c17_ab08916a",
      "revId": "de6dfdeaeacdada13a4cf2ac3a8b19cb595256dc",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "d00257cd_74796c6e",
        "filename": "/COMMIT_MSG",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 14,
      "author": {
        "id": 1962375
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-02-10T23:09:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There are actually quite a few, with some examples being the followings: [`allBuildFlagDeclarationsSingleton`](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:build/soong/aconfig/build_flags/build_flags_singleton.go;l\u003d116;drc\u003d1639ab5d69edf212ad42cb782548bc9a73a4dd0f), [`allTeamsSingleton`](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:build/soong/android/all_teams.go;l\u003d140;drc\u003d4a2f368b46f1da33a7bcfdd2a68bf0124971fe3d), [`lintSingleton`](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:build/soong/java/lint.go;l\u003d711;drc\u003d80b68c44cac5bead6f247f9026238338ee62302f), [`platformCompatConfigSingleton`](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:build/soong/java/platform_compat_config.go;l\u003d285;drc\u003d4715f9aed7b5522a7aeab1726fcdf187090cb8f9), ...etc.\n\nI have https://r.android.com/3487512 ready to late-register androidmk singleton. If this change looks good to you I\u0027ll submit this one instead and abandon the current change.",
      "parentUuid": "573af02e_a183a0f5",
      "revId": "de6dfdeaeacdada13a4cf2ac3a8b19cb595256dc",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
